   766→	/**
   767→	 * Recursively merges smaller faces of a mesh into their adjacent faces. The
   768→	 * procedure continues until there are no resulting faces with an area smaller
   769→	 * than the specified threshold.
   770→	 * 
   771→	 * @param mesh          a GROUP shape representing a conforming mesh the mesh to
   772→	 *                      perform area merging on
