   784→//		Algorithm 1 Find nearest neighbor
   785→//		function findNearestNeighbor(cover tree p, query
   786→//		point x, nearest neighbor so far y)
   787→//		1: if d(p;x) < d(y;x) then
   788→//		2: y  p
   789→//		3: for each child q of p sorted by distance to x do
   790→//		4: if d(y;x) > d(y;q)-maxdist(q) then
   791→//		5: y findNearestNeighbor(q;x;y)
   792→//		6: return y
